# Presence of this file tells the Makefile (mk/tier-helm.mk helm_upgrade_tier,
# helm_template_all_tiers; mk/common.mk helm-deps-update; mk/cloud/*.mk
# smoke-test targets) to SKIP `helm dependency update` for the platform tier.
#
# Why: platform's remote chart deps (redis, lakekeeper) are VENDORED as
# committed .tgz under charts/. Bitnami's legacy index now redirects the redis
# blob to Docker Hub OCI (registry-1.docker.io), which rate-limits (HTTP 429)
# and was failing AKS+GKE deploys. Vendoring + skipping dep-update removes that
# per-deploy network pull entirely.
#
# To refresh after bumping a dependency version in Chart.yaml:
#   make vendor-platform-deps
